    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18b81cdd8b1ad094344d148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是这种结果就满足了的话、可就不是你菱亚马逊姐的作风了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "339d38830bb010a87a25c35e632476e88bb2054812e5957d33e18664fbbbd858",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4a351e1726ff357f3ab92b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……得要继续努力才行了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9bb973fae4091a30f603e7b79bc5ee8452f028b14884a318a46c393cac0d50f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea42cf93fc630e15520463af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "露出这副不中用的样子可不行啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8940f54b07d21ec292b9920f31dad7d0b83029fadb9d4fb4c3ceca6132b703c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43d5dff085a067a7c55a079a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼！大概就这样吧！哼哼♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1b992337a9cca38088342fb094d5ca3e86439392153e3aee5e7cceb7bf28e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:106f35e46a997dea5acc1447",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊！这就是你菱亚马逊姐的实力啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bae7b3594f11bde4f3695520a6ac637ef649631f742c0345c5671dae4b436f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a47ac3ba8e8ccad4b3f1406",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未来也要一直跟着我走啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1efc6f0f296271e3623af4d468a59b61e3e9ea5248390521043bd11690a9c9d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4e4dfa14e51b1b8d64bf8b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶！这就是菱亚大姐的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c1b9ff71327053ec60a0439b322a036b76f06eccc6e31dad4ed8b599d5b2ec4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e95c158996f404105ea74b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么、该出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c813ba1c3e7771dd94950119778eda1da0e86352a959a9e8543bfd099e33353c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b17586c198b4ecd33848718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了！来单挑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dab691e1d58a1630923ab0d5661e566e93cce6c41ac062d4c9cdf4c9b3a909c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56fdb2cb7daf396be57d0f16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是伤脑筋。\r\n像这种时候就先休息吧！\r\n赛马娘累了也是会跑不动嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c60118cf3604cc1ecb0e4ca7440393d1f43d5a33353849dffb240084ba0c3f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8757c1d15ca1ba5ad2d701f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先輩からもバンドに誘われてたん\r\nだけど…断っちまった。ブライアン\r\n以外の相手は、考えられなくてさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b99b323f1543e302d953f1090231d5dc4cdaef0148f7ef8de382545b85d09ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c96f7bcc60e7a91bddfddf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時期的に追い込みかける子が増えて\r\nくるし、握りメシでもこさえるか。\r\n…さ、もうひと踏ん張りといこう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68fd8e949eddd7a7d459347d7231bd0f8a590ea5cec92350cb80e9c64a80b797",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e5adc68b1df99ed5574e5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不是看做不做得到，\r\n而是看想不想做来决定！\r\n不可以误判自己的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c58baded635be6bdc9dd55c3913dcd860124e20d6b25680699b12d1781c70fc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccda4e93e787936ff0815bef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，后辈们似乎也\r\n鼓起了干劲，跃跃欲试！\r\n追上菱亚大姐的背影吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08cb562491bedfe97cfcd7f6e307bbb650fe319ba1aa58216f74cd622967bad7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6754deacd85047378fc3c2e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "追上去！超过去！绝不后退一步！\r\n……啊！？哼……来单挑吧啊啊啊——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea65ccb0d100a063d8ce0ca31fd4ca5c1fdefc5de0a047988347c7f4f17fae6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:358d134596356118d4900623",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我和你一起跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb64489cfa3c82e256242a4e8f95ecb1904dbda171c8d811701a046382f8e2ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da5b640c4654fc8db41363a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条熊熊燃烧般的路……\r\n就让我和你一起跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f84f32cb833818f9eef87da7e0f64d5201514522bd9f5fdd3b725163861cc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9268d3f40860a9b290a960f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要走啰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1453c15d06c44ea9a1a1f7e2ac66241306f371a692daa6bc36e23bfd4dd034f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
